    "body": "Problem:\nCan't reliably detect Visual selection changes: CursorMoved misses changes\nthat don't move the cursor (\"viw\" on the last char of a word, blockwise \"$\"\non an empty line).\n\nSolution:\nAdd VisualChanged, fired (deferred, via `aucmd_defer()`) when Visual/Select\nmode starts, the Visual mode changes, or the cursor, anchor, or blockwise \"$\"\nchanges. No event-data: use `getregionpos()`.\n\nPicks up #26052 (closed as stale) with its review addressed: bare event, fires\non cursor/anchor moves, uses `aucmd_defer()`.\n\nOpen question: the pattern currently matches the buffer name (like\nCursorMoved). Should it match the Visual mode instead (`au VisualChanged V`)?\nHard to change after release.\n\nFixes #19708\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-15T16:12:11Z",
